# Local dev defaults to embedded PGlite (real Postgres in WASM) — zero setup,
# data persisted to web/.pgdata. Just run: npm install && npm run db:seed && npm run dev
#
# To use a real Postgres SERVER (docker compose up -d db at repo root, or a
# hosted DB like Vercel Postgres / Railway), set DATABASE_URL and run
# `npm run db:push && npm run db:seed`:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://bbb:bbb@localhost:5433/bbb
